Upstream-Name: querencia-dateien
Comment: Generated from copyright.in by werkzeuge/copyright-erzeugen.py.
 The cargo-vendor/ stanzas come from the vendored crates' Cargo.toml.
 The source is the workspace querencia-runtime (as for querencia-shell);
 this package builds only the crate querencia-dateien with its libraries
 querencia-dateiarbeit and querencia-oberflaeche.

